"COMMENTED","commit_id":"87c03fc97f8754b02e8ee7a2f605fab791283123","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4040651377","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-31T22:47:11Z"},{"id":4091486482,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7z3yES","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"87c03fc97f8754b02e8ee7a2f605fab791283123","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4091486482","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-10T17:45:13Z"},{"id":4091736470,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7z4vGW","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"87c03fc97f8754b02e8ee7a2f605fab791283123","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\n\n**Testing project:** [test_ssao_multibounce.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26637354/test_ssao_multibounce.zip)\n\n*For benchmarking:* [test_ssao_multibounce.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26637612/test_ssao_multibounce.zip)\n\n## Preview\n\n*The default SSAO intensity is `2.0`. By increasing it to a value around `3.0`, you can get a more similar result to multi-bounce disabled on brighter materials, but this will make it stronger than before on darker materials.*\n\nNo multi-bounce | With multi-bounce | With multi-bounce + intensity 3.0\n-|-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e48c2f5f-2e61-4770-aaba-52ced037e736\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6593c91c-7d8c-47bf-bdaf-0c987e5f0f23\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6be26951-0f47-4ec8-8089-6ee9274ad286\" />\n\nNo multi-bounce | With multi-bounce | With multi-bounce + intensity 3.0\n-|-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72d7edf2-441d-4a2f-a0b2-cf42d620a621\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25182211-8df2-4124-a1f7-84d4efe2976c\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef0f8f31-79fb-4442-beb3-673f0e42f01f\" />\n\nNo multi-bounce | With multi-bounce | With multi-bounce + intensity 3.0\n-|-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/319694d7-a75e-4890-b255-840794289359\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7e176a3-1c2b-4541-bc73-1ecb8fbc682c\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a7c2ee2-5e1d-4d76-9a43-eafc4faf193d\" />\n\n## Benchmark\n\nUsing the second testing project linked above, run with a release export template (`production=yes lto=full`). All the viewport's pixels are covered by opaque geometry and other rendering features are turned down to the minimum, so that we can measure and isolate material shading cost as much as possible.\n\nDifferences might be subtle, but all scenarios are GPU-limited, and I've made sure the difference is reproducible across multiple runs.\n\n<details open>\n\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\n\n- **CPU:** AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-6000 CL30)\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 43)\n</details>\n\n### 3840×2160 fullscreen\n\nBefore | After\n-|-\n2186 FPS (0.46 mspf) | 2166 FPS (0.46 mspf)\n\n### 7680×4320 fullscreen\n\nBefore | After\n-|-\n769 FPS (1.30 mspf) | 760 FPS (1.32 mspf)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4091736470","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-10T18:31:56Z"},{"id":4100704841,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc70a8pJ","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"87c03fc97f8754b02e8ee7a2f605fab791283123","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?u=6ecace2ddb6505607f21e3c41da42157298bd406&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","login":"blueskythlikesclouds","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds"},"body":"Looks great to me! Bastiaan's feedback about only enabling by default for new projects should be addressed, though.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4100704841","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-13T17:31:25Z"},{"id":4142583068,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc726s0c","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"87c03fc97f8754b02e8ee7a2f605fab791283123","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7585719?u=4a3628ad6d02b550753f186137601d56a8ef66e6&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KenzieMac130","id":7585719,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODU3MTk=","login":"KenzieMac130","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4142583068","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-20T18:44:15Z"},{"id":4374742174,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBMFEng","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","commit_id":"8f8d33d7c9b3bce9da2ed792e7208d747e77b51a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"Reviewed again in a rendering meeting. This looks great! \n\nOverall two things need to happen before merging. \n1. As Bastiaan pointed out, the project setting needs to be set to false be default, but can be set to true for new projects. See how Jolt and D3D12 are handled to understand how to make that happen. Since this is a big visual change it has to be opt-in for existing projects\n2. Remove the render_mode entirely. We are not convinced it is needed. This is a case of future-proofing for something speculative. Instead, let's go ahead with the project setting only, and then wait and see if any users request to be able to disable it per material. ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4374742174","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-05-27T17:52:12Z"},{"id":4377193043,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBOaqUw","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"9855b634c4086fb3fbd5fd3dc55d79f0821497cf","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7585719?u=4a3628ad6d02b550753f186137601d56a8ef66e6&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KenzieMac130","id":7585719,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODU3MTk=","login":"KenzieMac130","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4377193043","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-05-28T01:15:18Z"},{"id":4377239580,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBOdgHA","state