alse,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4908402995","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-08-11T16:18:39Z"},{"id":4940819375,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJn7rrw","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","commit_id":"021263cc152f91a19117373625b489517064b5eb","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"Code looks great to me. \r\n\r\nI would remove the implementation in Compatibility though. No point making users pay the price for something that only benefits AO maps (which are not super commonly used by projects using the compatibility renderer). Its fine for the compatibility renderer to not look quite as nice. The whole point of it is to avoid cutting edge features to favour performance\r\n\r\nSo before merging:\r\n1. remove the code from the compatibility renderer\r\n2. Squash all your commits together so there is just one commit to merge)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4940819375","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-08-14T20:07:29Z"},{"id":4974869491,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKIZ78w","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","commit_id":"e532658b4dc30b46ae788890921a5b4ced93416b","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"Let's remove from the mobile renderer too. We can consider adding it in once we add SSAO (if we use last frame depth for SSAO instead of applying SSAO in post).\n\nIf we do add this in to the mobile shader we should guard it behind an a check if AO is actually used in the user shader and a spec constant for if a decal actually touches the object (since the only source of AO would be one of those)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4974869491","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-08-19T17:21:55Z"},{"id":5012763369,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKsiy6Q","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"fa2b30e7a17f20af33f241b5bacb75493c909b5a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0